msgstr "Volver al bot de Telegram"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:43
msgid ""
"Spotify for Creators → add an existing podcast with its RSS feed. A code is "
"sent to the owner email of the feed."
msgstr ""
"Spotify for Creators → añadir un podcast que ya existe, con su feed RSS. "
"Llega un código al correo del propietario del feed."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:49
msgid ""
"Podcasts Connect with your Apple Account → add a show with an RSS feed. "
"Apple reviews it, usually within a few days. Many other apps take their "
"catalogue from Apple."
msgstr ""
"Podcasts Connect con tu cuenta de Apple → añadir un programa con feed RSS. "
"Apple lo revisa, normalmente en unos días. Muchas otras apps sacan su "
"catálogo de Apple."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:55
msgid ""
"YouTube Studio → Create → Submit RSS feed. A code is sent to the owner email"
" of the feed; each episode becomes a video with the podcast artwork."
msgstr ""
"YouTube Studio → Crear → Enviar feed RSS. Llega un código al correo del "
"propietario del feed; cada episodio se convierte en un vídeo con la carátula"
" del podcast."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:61
msgid ""
"iVoox Podcasters → create a new show → \"Do you already have a show?\" → "
"paste the feed."
msgstr ""
"iVoox Podcasters → crear nuevo programa → «¿Ya tienes un programa?» → pega "
"el feed."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:67
msgid ""
"Amazon Music for Podcasters → add your podcast with its RSS feed. Also "
"reaches Audible."
msgstr ""
"Amazon Music for Podcasters → añade tu podcast con su feed RSS. Llega "
"también a Audible."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:73
msgid ""
"Paste the feed, no account needed. It feeds many independent podcast apps."
msgstr ""
"Pega el feed, sin crear cuenta. Alimenta a muchas apps de podcast "
"independientes."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:79
msgid "Paste the feed, no account needed."
msgstr "Pega el feed, sin crear cuenta."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:85
msgid ""
"Creator Studio → Claim ownership → paste the feed. A link is sent to the "
"owner email of the feed."
msgstr ""
"Creator Studio → Claim ownership → pega el feed. Llega un enlace al correo "
"del propietario del feed."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:91
msgid "Deezer for Podcasters → add your podcast with its RSS feed."
msgstr "Deezer for Podcasters → añade tu podcast con su feed RSS."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:236 includes/class-distribution.php:286
msgid "VozCaster — Distribute"
msgstr "VozCaster — Difundir"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:237
msgid "Distribute"
msgstr "Difundir"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:246
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para hacer esto."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:271
msgid "Not submitted"
msgstr "Sin enviar"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:272
msgid "Submitted, pending"
msgstr "Enviado, pendiente"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:273
msgid "Live"
msgstr "Publicado"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:276 includes/class-settings.php:980
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:277
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:278
msgid "Square artwork of 1400–3000 px"
msgstr "Carátula cuadrada de 1400–3000 px"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:279
msgid "Apple Podcasts category"
msgstr "Categoría de Apple Podcasts"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:280 includes/class-settings.php:981
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Autor"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:281
msgid "Owner email"
msgstr "Correo del propietario"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:282
msgid "At least one published episode"
msgstr "Al menos un episodio publicado"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:288
msgid ""
"Submit your podcast feed to each platform once; after that they pick up "
"every new episode by themselves. They are ordered by importance. Mark each "
"one as you go, so you can see at a glance where your podcast is still "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Envía el feed de tu podcast a cada plataforma una sola vez; a partir de ahí "
"recogen solas cada episodio nuevo. Están ordenadas por importancia. Marca "
"cada una según avances, para ver de un vistazo dónde falta todavía tu "
"podcast."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:294
msgid "Podcast:"
msgstr "Podcast:"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:304
msgid "This podcast feed was not found."
msgstr "No se ha encontrado este feed de podcast."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:306
msgid "Feed address"
msgstr "Dirección del feed"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:309
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copiado"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:309
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:312
msgid "Ready to submit?"
msgstr "¿Listo para enviar?"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:319
msgid ""
"Platforms reject feeds with missing data. Fill them in from the bot with "
"/podcast, or in PowerPress → Settings."
msgstr ""
"Las plataformas rechazan los feeds con datos incompletos. Complétalos desde "
"el bot con /podcast, o en PowerPress → Ajustes."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:322
msgid "Platforms"
msgstr "Plataformas"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:332
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "Enviar"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:333
msgid "Find my podcast"
msgstr "Buscar mi podcast"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:341 includes/class-settings.php:982
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:346
msgid "Link to the podcast page (optional)"
msgstr "Enlace a la ficha del podcast (opcional)"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:347
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Guardar"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:349
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Abrir"

#: includes/class-distribution.php:358
msgid ""
"The VozCaster bot checks Apple Podcasts by itself and marks it as live when "
"your feed appears there. Use /difundir in the bot to see this list on your "
"phone."
msgstr ""
"El bot de VozCaster comprueba Apple Podcasts por su cuenta y lo marca como "
"publicado cuando tu feed aparece allí. Usa /difundir en el bot para ver esta"
" lista en el móvil."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:98 includes/class-pairing.php:108
#: includes/class-pairing.php:129 includes/class-pairing.php:329
msgid "Connect with VozCaster"
msgstr "Conectar con VozCaster"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:109
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Conectar"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:131
msgid ""
"VozCaster is a Telegram bot that turns your voice notes into published "
"podcast episodes on this site. Connect your account once and publish from "
"Telegram."
msgstr ""
"VozCaster es un bot de Telegram que convierte tus notas de voz en episodios "
"de podcast publicados en esta web. Conecta tu cuenta una vez y publica desde"
" Telegram."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:136
msgid ""
"PowerPress is not active. Install and activate it before connecting, so "
"episodes reach your podcast feed."
msgstr ""
"PowerPress no está activo. Instálalo y actívalo antes de conectar, para que "
"los episodios lleguen al feed de tu podcast."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:142
msgid ""
"Your account is already connected to the bot. Connecting again replaces the "
"previous connection, and with several podcasts it switches the one you "
"publish to."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta ya está conectada al bot. Si vuelves a conectar, se sustituye la "
"conexión anterior y, si hay varios podcasts, cambias a aquel en el que "
"publicas."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:158 includes/class-pairing.php:250
msgid "Connect in Telegram"
msgstr "Conectar en Telegram"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:167 includes/class-pairing.php:257
msgid ""
"Telegram opens with the bot. Press Start and confirm the connection there. "
"The link works once and expires in 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Se abre Telegram con el bot. Pulsa Iniciar y confirma allí la conexión. El "
"enlace sirve una sola vez y caduca en 15 minutos."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:171
msgid ""
"The address of this site cannot be passed to the bot automatically. Open the"
" bot, send /conectar and paste this address:"
msgstr ""
"La dirección de esta web no se puede pasar al bot automáticamente. Abre el "
"bot, envía /conectar y pega esta dirección:"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:176 includes/class-pairing.php:232
msgid "Open the bot in Telegram"
msgstr "Abrir el bot en Telegram"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:202
msgid ""
"Log in with your account on this site to connect it with the VozCaster bot "
"and publish podcast episodes from Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión con tu cuenta de esta web para conectarla con el bot de "
"VozCaster y publicar episodios de podcast desde Telegram."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:204
msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:212
msgid ""
"Your account is not authorized to publish from VozCaster yet. Ask the site "
"administrator for access."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta todavía no está autorizada para publicar desde VozCaster. Pide "
"acceso al administrador de la web."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:223
msgid "Your account is already connected to the bot."
msgstr "Tu cuenta ya está conectada al bot."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:223
msgid "Connecting again replaces the previous connection."
msgstr "Si vuelves a conectar, se sustituye la conexión anterior."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:229
msgid "Open the bot, send /conectar and paste this address:"
msgstr "Abre el bot, envía /conectar y pega esta dirección:"

#. translators: %s: podcast name.
#: includes/class-pairing.php:249
#, php-format
msgid "Connect «%s» in Telegram"
msgstr "Conectar «%s» en Telegram"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:270
msgid "Your role is not authorized to publish from VozCaster."
msgstr "Tu perfil no está autorizado a publicar desde VozCaster."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:325
msgid "Publish your podcast from Telegram."
msgstr "Publica tu podcast desde Telegram."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:326
msgid "Connect your account with the VozCaster bot in one click."
msgstr "Conecta tu cuenta con el bot de VozCaster en un clic."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:330
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Descartar"

